1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 10=

4
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,120
I must be dead.

5
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,920
Silly He.

6
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,840
He Xiaoyuan!

7
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,560
What are you two doing?

8
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,200
So I wasn't

9
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,480
dreaming after all.

10
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,840
Weren't you chasing after
the Crown Prince every day?

11
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,120
How did you end up with someone else?

12
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,680
He's

13
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,400
a new friend I met

14
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:51,840
outside the palace.

15
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:56,120
Actually,

16
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,040
the Crown Prince

17
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,280
was never the one I truly loved.

18
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,600
You must have pursued the Crown Prince

19
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,160
to pay for parents' medicine, right?

20
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,080
And now,

21
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,720
you've met someone you truly love.

22
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:26,960
All right.

23
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,840
Feelings can't be forced.

24
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,080
We never expected you
to bring honor to the family.

25
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,280
All we want is for you
to be safe and happy.

26
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,880
Just

27
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,800
don't get yourself

28
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,400
covered in wounds
over these things again.

29
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,600
You there.

30
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,600
What's your name?

31
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,600
What does your family do?

32
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:46,840
I...

33
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,840
Zhao Daniu.

34
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,800
He's

35
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,160
an escort
from the Western Market Escort Agency.

36
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,870
Daniu.

37
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,280
You do look sturdy.

38
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,000
Go.

39
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,080
Wash the vegetables,

40
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,840
and fetch a bucket
of water while you're at it.

41
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,120
Me?

42
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,600
Yes, Daniu. Go on.

43
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,880
Daniu.

44
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,360
All right.

45
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,600
Seeing how attentively this young man
has cared for you these past few days,

46
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,280
I figured there might
be something between you two.

47
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,280
All right.

48
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,560
A grown daughter
won't stay home forever.

49
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,120
Come with me.

50
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,000
Sit.

51
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,400
Here, take a look.

52
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,440
This is my latest treasure.

53
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,400
I think

54
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,800
just adding pungent sulfur

55
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,880
to this smoke bomb isn't enough.

56
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,080
If you ask me,

57
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,440
you should add some chili powder.

58
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,560
It'll be even more effective
at scaring off

59
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,600
the thieves who steal
melons from our field.

60
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:03,880
Brilliant!

61
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,120
Why didn't I think of such a good idea?

62
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:08,000
Just you wait.
In the next couple of days,

63
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,440
I'll make some improvements
and upgrade it.

64
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,520
Oh, right.

65
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,520
These

66
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,680
are a little gift for you two.

67
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,840
What kind of gift is this?

68
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,360
They're just two stones.

69
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,600
These are no ordinary stones.

70
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,240
They're called Phantom Stones.

71
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,800
They contain magnetic cores

72
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:24,840
coated with iron powder.

73
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,040
When someone speaks, the sound
waves make the stones vibrate,

74
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:30,000
causing the cores to tremble
and leave patterns in the iron coating,

75
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,480
like a needle carving into wax.

76
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,600
The sound is thus preserved
within the stones.

77
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,040
What does that mean?

78
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,840
Never mind.

79
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,240
In short,

80
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,360
after I carefully modified

81
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,920
these little treasures,

82
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,680
they can record sound.

83
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,600
Record sound?

84
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,800
So bitter!

85
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,040
All right.

86
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,600
Finally finished it.

87
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:14,240
Let me show you something amazing.

88
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,680
What's this?

89
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,240
My sister invented it.

90
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,120
One for you,

91
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,920
and one for me.

92
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,360
This is one of my sister's
amazing inventions.

93
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,560
Tap it once,

94
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,800
and it records sound.

95
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:35,160
Add a drop of water,
and it plays the recording.

96
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,720
I don't believe you.

97
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,040
Escort Zhao Daniu,

98
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:45,240
how many bowls did you break
while washing dishes today?

99
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,600
Escort Zhao Daniu,

100
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:56,000
how many bowls did you break
while washing dishes today?

101
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,920
It really is an amazing device.

102
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,280
From now on, I'll record

103
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,160
every embarrassing thing you do.

104
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,840
If you ever pick on me,

105
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,160
I'll play them for everyone

106
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,600
and ruin the mighty
Seventh Prince's reputation.

107
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,040
Then you'll...

108
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,680
I'll...

109
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,840
What?

110
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,360
Lose my temper

111
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,840
and pick on you?

112
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,360
You...

113
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,280
Don't...

114
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,800
Too late.

115
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:38,480
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

116
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,520
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

117
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:44,160
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

118
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:49,000
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

119
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,760
♪My heart has long known♪

120
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,200
♪We made a promise long ago♪

121
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,120
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

122
00:06:56,800 --> 00:07:00,120
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

123
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:03,280
♪How much must I let go♪

124
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,280
♪For one moment♪

125
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:08,180
♪To hold each other close♪

126
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:13,040
♪Would that be enough?♪

127
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,920
This is wonderful.

128
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,240
But

129
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,360
once you ascend the throne

130
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,480
and become occupied
with affairs of state,

131
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,800
you won't remember

132
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,720
little things like watching
the stars with me, will you?

133
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,160
When have I ever broken my word?

134
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,360
Come, pinky promise.

135
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,240
Could you

136
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,360
promise me one thing first?

137
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,160
I know what you're going to say.

138
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,960
Zhao Junyao

139
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,160
is a kind but weak Crown Prince

140
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,200
unfit for the task.

141
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:57,640
It's only a matter of time
before he loses the realm.

142
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,080
But

143
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,520
he's innocent too.

144
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:01,600
In this lifetime,

145
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,160
I won't kill him.

146
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,280
Zhao Boqing,

147
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,720
I really

148
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,240
like you so much.

149
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,400
Your feelings for me

150
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,160
aren't allowed to change
for a hundred years either.

151
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,480
Are those the men after us?

152
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,760
It's Fu Yang.

153
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,240
I have to go.

154
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,240
Xiaoyuan,

155
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,360
stay here and recover.

156
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,000
Once I've taken care of everything,

157
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,720
I'll come for you.

158
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,240
By the way,

159
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,640
my parents' cough has gotten much worse,

160
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:49,280
so they secretly
came back here to recuperate.

161
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:51,040
You're the only person I've told.

162
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,400
Don't tell anyone else.

163
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,480
So you want me to cover for you?

164
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,080
Will you or won't you?

165
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:02,880
Silly He.

166
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,720
Who else would I cover for if not you?

167
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,480
Forgive me for arriving late.

168
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,360
Your Highness, are you hurt?

169
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:20,840
I'm fine.

170
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,320
How did Your Highness escape

171
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,600
on the day of the attack?

172
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,520
I've searched everywhere for days,

173
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,840
but couldn't find you or Miss Xiaoyuan.

174
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,840
The Princess and the Crown Prince

175
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,840
have been beside themselves with worry.

176
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:36,040
Miss Xiaoyuan...

177
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,960
A farming family rescued us.

178
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,040
I left her there
to recover from her injuries.

179
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,120
Let's return to the palace first.

180
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,000
Yes.

181
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:51,840
By the way,

182
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:53,360
how is the investigation
into the assassins going?

183
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,520
I was just about
to report to Your Highness.

184
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,480
There were thirteen assassins in total.

185
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,840
I captured one alive.

186
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,120
He has confessed

187
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:00,880
that they were

188
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:01,840
acting on the Yu family's orders.

189
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,520
Their targets

190
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,240
were Your Highness and Miss Xiaoyuan.

191
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,000
I see.

192
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,600
The Yu family again.

193
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,720
(Since the Yu family caused trouble)

194
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,600
(with the cellar
and the military accounts,)

195
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,240
(I clearly gave them a warning.)

196
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:16,880
(Now,)

197
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,520
(with the military funds case
working against them,)

198
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,320
(they should be keeping a low profile.)

199
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,000
(The assassination on the night
of the Lantern Festival)

200
00:10:22,340 --> 00:10:23,220
(shouldn't have been their doing.)

201
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,180
(Qingyan Palace)

202
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,600
Your Highness.

203
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,000
We've made some initial findings
on the assassins

204
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,100
from the night of the Lantern Festival.

205
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,120
Go on.

206
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,840
The weapons used by those assassins

207
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,600
were deliberately made to resemble
those of the martial world,

208
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,120
but their distinctive forging technique

209
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,240
matches military specifications.

210
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,840
Their movements
were disciplined and coordinated.

211
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,480
They were no ordinary rabble.

212
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,640
They seemed more like

213
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,480
rigorously trained private soldiers.

214
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,000
Private soldiers?

215
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,600
Whose command are they under?

216
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,600
Their escape route

217
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,520
ultimately led toward
the Observatory north of the city.

218
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,360
The Imperial Preceptor?

219
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,120
Also,

220
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,960
I found another clue.

221
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,960
The arrow you asked me to investigate

222
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,480
has neither a blood groove nor barbs.

223
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,480
My guess is

224
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,840
that when the assassins struck,

225
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:10,720
it seems

226
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:13,000
killing Your Highness
wasn't their only objective.

227
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,880
Their deployment
seemed more like a test.

228
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:15,960
Or rather,

229
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,000
a warning.

230
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,640
A test?

231
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,600
A warning?

232
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,520
They're warning me

233
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,440
to stay away from certain people.

234
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,080
(The Imperial Preceptor...)

235
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,480
(Are you really
trying to stop the cycle,)

236
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,600
(or are you trying to use it)

237
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,600
(to achieve some hidden purpose?)

238
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:43,840
(Fu Yang...)

239
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,640
(What role are you playing in all this?)

240
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,720
Your Highness
rarely drinks this heavily.

241
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:54,760
Is

242
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,600
something troubling you?

243
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,720
I think

244
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,600
I've fallen hopelessly
in love with He Xiaoyuan.

245
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,840
Your Highness, mind your words.

246
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,240
You...

247
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,440
You insisted that we could
never walk the same path.

248
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:08,960
But

249
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,320
whenever she

250
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,240
appears before me,

251
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,640
every time

252
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:19,200
she finds herself in danger,

253
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,120
I'm grateful

254
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,720
that the two of us are trapped together

255
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,600
in this endless cycle.

256
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:25,600
That way,

257
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,520
even if death parts us,

258
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,840
we'll still have

259
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:32,360
another lifetime in which to meet again.

260
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,760
Fate cannot be defied.

261
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,600
If you insist on becoming
entangled with the companion star,

262
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,960
Great Yue will surely face disaster.

263
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,240
Then let it come!

264
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,720
If I can't even protect

265
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,480
the woman I love,

266
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:50,080
even if I gain the realm,

267
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:54,720
wouldn't I still be utterly alone?

268
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,600
Absurd!

269
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,720
How can Your Highness
put your personal feelings

270
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:01,360
before the people of Great Yue?

271
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,720
Enough.

272
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,000
Forget this endless cycle.

273
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,640
Forget the realm.

274
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,240
I don't care anymore.

275
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,200
I don't care.

276
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:25,600
Absurd!

277
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,000
Absurd!

278
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,880
If you insist on this course,

279
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:38,000
then I will...

280
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:51,480
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

281
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,520
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

282
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:57,160
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

283
00:13:57,680 --> 00:14:02,000
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

284
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,760
♪My heart has long known♪

285
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:07,200
♪We made a promise long ago♪

286
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,120
